{title: Kisi Ki Muskurahton Pe}
{artist: Mukesh Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m]Kisi ki muskurahaton pe ho nisar        [C#m][F#m]Kisi ka dard mil sake to le udhaar
[F#m][A]Kisi ke waaste ho tere dil mein pyaar        [A][B][C#m]Jeena isi ka naam hai

[C#m]Maana apni jeb se fakeer hein        [C#m][F#m][C#m]Phir bhi yaaron dil ke ham ameer hein

[C#m]Mitte jo pyaar ke liye woh zindagi        [C#m][F#m]Chale bahaar ke liye woh zindagi
[F#m][A]Kisi ko ho na ho hamein to aitbaar        [A][B][C#m]Jeena isi ka naam hai

[C#m]Rishta dil se dil ke aitbaar ka        [C#m][F#m][C#m]Zinda hai hami se naam pyaar ka
[C#m]Ki marke bhi kisi ko yaad ayenge        [C#m][F#m]Kisi ke aansuo mein muskuraanyenge
[F#m][A]Kahega phool har kali se baar baar        [A][B][C#m]Jeena isi ka naam hai

